Prov.get('key_A') → { primaryNodeId: 'sec_p19', role: 'body' }
Sec.get('sec_p19') → { title: '…', page: 19, ord: 19, summary: '…' }

join 后 StructuredView(key_A) =
  key_A → sec_p19 · p20（展示页）· ord=19 · 同节? 与 key_B 比 page/ord
```

